## What changed

`crates/app/tests/lathe_post_css.rs` Gate map header named `app::post`. The post suite's module lives in the post crate since the M4.1 split (`crates/post/src/post/`), so the xtask test `no_gate_map_names_a_moved_module_as_app` failed on main. Corrected the same way #965 corrected the other headers.

Header before:

    //! Gate map (M4.4): covers app::cutting, app::cutting_turn,
    //! app::commands (ApplyCuttingData), app::posting (the CSS PARAMs),
    //! app::post (both lathe dialects), app::project (the additive key),
    //! tools::turning_data.

Header after:

    //! Gate map (M4.4): covers app::cutting, app::cutting_turn,
    //! app::commands (ApplyCuttingData), app::posting (the CSS PARAMs),
    //! post::post (both lathe dialects), app::project (the additive key),
    //! tools::turning_data.

Other entries checked against `crates/*/src`: `app::cutting`, `app::cutting_turn`, `app::commands`, `app::posting`, `app::project` exist under `crates/app/src`; `tools::turning_data` exists under `crates/tools/src`. No other header needed a fix.

Comment-only change. `.claude/PROCESS_VERSION` not touched.

## Tests

- `cargo test -p xtask`: 48 passed, 0 failed (includes `gate_maps_tests::no_gate_map_names_a_moved_module_as_app`).
- `cargo xtask gate quick --dry-run --base origin/main`: selects `app:lathe_post_css` (whole suite, suite changed outside its test fns), one step.

## Not exercised

The suite itself was not run; the change is a comment line.

Changelog: none

Fixes #1184
